    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>An object (or collection of objects) of mystical significance either grants you powers or altered you to give you powers.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.QD7BBCX8C7mnA1FJ]{Awareness}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.US0ZfFzUJ9CEcS6M]{Intuition}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Materials powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.3TkLPa5kqOCMwqAC]{Harvest Life Force}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.9bEdvGXsu11HsRGq]{Magical Shield}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.dso225lOGqvT3mlp]{Momentary Power}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.9zUMwCRxZEVpKsSV]{Relic Drain}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Green abilities:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.92ddsAQhu7WS7DG4]{Draw Power}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.IAYdRIjThFf0AWR7]{Punishment}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d10, d10, d6 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
